{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BitSummit 2024 Sponsor Award PlayStation\u00aePRIZE, INNOVATIVE OUTLAW AWARD NOMINEE&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game where five protagonists\u2014men and women who boarded the enigmatic talking elevator, &quot;Mr. Elevator&quot;\u2014solve puzzles in a mysterious otherworld they are lost in, searching for what each of them seeks. Freely explore the unique world, drawn in the style of early Windows Paint software, and thoroughly enjoy the puzzles that appear before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f37e95ebd254cde03704e54fcb1b2e85.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f37e95ebd254cde03704e54fcb1b2e85.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f37e95ebd254cde03704e54fcb1b2e85.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Mr. Elevator. <br>Are you looking for something?<br>If you're in trouble, I might be able to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e236773cabbfd75b609d73e7157839cd.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e236773cabbfd75b609d73e7157839cd.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e236773cabbfd75b609d73e7157839cd.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems that five men and women have wandered in here.<br>Are you... looking for someone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/b33a719f78c51f3781da2fa4ee84e090.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/b33a719f78c51f3781da2fa4ee84e090.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many doors lined up. Let's try knocking or hitting them. <br>Oh, the door opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f024574f4d44d76d18b6347197ec62ef.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f024574f4d44d76d18b6347197ec62ef.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f024574f4d44d76d18b6347197ec62ef.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you may walk in the dark,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/0d66a59fadc5b6f2d25d2a38762ca92f.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/0d66a59fadc5b6f2d25d2a38762ca92f.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/0d66a59fadc5b6f2d25d2a38762ca92f.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in vast fields, you may encounter strange creatures or stone statues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/5431e7b35b5312646861be9eb2dbbef6.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/5431e7b35b5312646861be9eb2dbbef6.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/5431e7b35b5312646861be9eb2dbbef6.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does a broken smartphone have any use?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/aaca21304299be41dfb7de7f4e026f38.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/aaca21304299be41dfb7de7f4e026f38.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/aaca21304299be41dfb7de7f4e026f38.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This looks good for turning screws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/73a7aeae204af33d45a81b4d955923c6.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/73a7aeae204af33d45a81b4d955923c6.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/73a7aeae204af33d45a81b4d955923c6.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you might hold a book and think about how to use the items you found,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/507afadcf9bc4cb2a84c2ddbb6131c95.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/507afadcf9bc4cb2a84c2ddbb6131c95.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/507afadcf9bc4cb2a84c2ddbb6131c95.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you might listen to a walkie-talkie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e4ff0316dd2b0e0fc0f18a42738a4dee.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e4ff0316dd2b0e0fc0f18a42738a4dee.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e4ff0316dd2b0e0fc0f18a42738a4dee.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How is it? Do you think you'll find what you're looking for?<br>If you like, you can take your time to find what you're looking for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'll always be watching over you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0How to Play (Press Esc to show)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: W, A, S, D<br>View: Move mouse<br>Run: Shift<br><br>Right hand: Right mouse button<br>Left hand: Left mouse button<br>Move cursor: Move mouse while holding a mouse button<br><br>Action (while pointing the cursor at an object you can interact with):<br>\u3000Right hand: 3, 4, C, V<br>\u3000Left hand: 1, 2, Z, X<br><br>Switch Items<br>\u3000Right hand: E<br>\u3000Left hand: Q<br><br>Zoom Item (while holding an item):<br>\u3000Both hands: Hold both mouse buttons<br><br>Switch Cursor (when hands are out): Shift</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ELEVATOR MAN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387470/1f2ec0f585fc021c92341ef1cb4c84ca8136a394.jpg"},{"name":"MR. DISASSEMBLY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387470/b274a9e545e0fc57e0685f424d35c698674a1dd4.jpg"},{"name":"DR. OCCULT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387470/24016ff585ff38c95901cffbd04cf503581ac5e8.jpg"},{"name":"HIGH SCHOOL GIRL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387470/ab695045ebbc18484cf2124782058a3a0f913e11.jpg"},{"name":"JOB SEEKER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387470/a9a253eb28b949208570bce52ae381ad7fd961d6.jpg"},{"name":"ELEVATOR MAN SECOND HALF","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387470/428c0596d798c6bcae4cf82f8916b0f198b26ac9.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387470/f3cf336d3f322fa4b3d0655bb4ef86b3a89efff3.jpg"},{"name":"EVERYONE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387470/72336348750ba3aceab22c6318c2f8a95034e1fc.jpg"},{"name":"OPEN REEL TAPE 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387470/e79691d9a900f642b42867473acbd937aba23d99.jpg"},{"name":"OPEN REEL TAPE 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2387470/e79691d9a900f642b42867473acbd937aba23d99.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2387470?t=1771475590","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/877fb63c9b08a8c5252460f3330fc63680632c65/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771475590","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/195039076f10f82734a43f60f6805791045119e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771475590","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/195039076f10f82734a43f60f6805791045119e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771475590","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3014400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BitSummit 2024 Sponsor Award PlayStation\u00aePRIZE, INNOVATIVE OUTLAW AWARD NOMINEE&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game where five protagonists\u2014men and women who boarded the enigmatic talking elevator, &quot;Mr. Elevator&quot;\u2014solve puzzles in a mysterious otherworld they are lost in, searching for what each of them seeks. Freely explore the unique world, drawn in the style of early Windows Paint software, and thoroughly enjoy the puzzles that appear before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f37e95ebd254cde03704e54fcb1b2e85.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f37e95ebd254cde03704e54fcb1b2e85.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f37e95ebd254cde03704e54fcb1b2e85.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Mr. Elevator. <br>Are you looking for something?<br>If you're in trouble, I might be able to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e236773cabbfd75b609d73e7157839cd.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e236773cabbfd75b609d73e7157839cd.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e236773cabbfd75b609d73e7157839cd.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems that five men and women have wandered in here.<br>Are you... looking for someone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/b33a719f78c51f3781da2fa4ee84e090.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/b33a719f78c51f3781da2fa4ee84e090.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many doors lined up. Let's try knocking or hitting them. <br>Oh, the door opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f024574f4d44d76d18b6347197ec62ef.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f024574f4d44d76d18b6347197ec62ef.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f024574f4d44d76d18b6347197ec62ef.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you may walk in the dark,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/0d66a59fadc5b6f2d25d2a38762ca92f.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/0d66a59fadc5b6f2d25d2a38762ca92f.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/0d66a59fadc5b6f2d25d2a38762ca92f.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in vast fields, you may encounter strange creatures or stone statues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/5431e7b35b5312646861be9eb2dbbef6.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/5431e7b35b5312646861be9eb2dbbef6.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/5431e7b35b5312646861be9eb2dbbef6.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does a broken smartphone have any use?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/aaca21304299be41dfb7de7f4e026f38.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/aaca21304299be41dfb7de7f4e026f38.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/aaca21304299be41dfb7de7f4e026f38.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This looks good for turning screws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/73a7aeae204af33d45a81b4d955923c6.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/73a7aeae204af33d45a81b4d955923c6.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/73a7aeae204af33d45a81b4d955923c6.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you might hold a book and think about how to use the items you found,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/507afadcf9bc4cb2a84c2ddbb6131c95.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/507afadcf9bc4cb2a84c2ddbb6131c95.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/507afadcf9bc4cb2a84c2ddbb6131c95.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you might listen to a walkie-talkie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e4ff0316dd2b0e0fc0f18a42738a4dee.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e4ff0316dd2b0e0fc0f18a42738a4dee.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e4ff0316dd2b0e0fc0f18a42738a4dee.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How is it? Do you think you'll find what you're looking for?<br>If you like, you can take your time to find what you're looking for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'll always be watching over you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0How to Play (Press Esc to show)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: W, A, S, D<br>View: Move mouse<br>Run: Shift<br><br>Right hand: Right mouse button<br>Left hand: Left mouse button<br>Move cursor: Move mouse while holding a mouse button<br><br>Action (while pointing the cursor at an object you can interact with):<br>\u3000Right hand: 3, 4, C, V<br>\u3000Left hand: 1, 2, Z, X<br><br>Switch Items<br>\u3000Right hand: E<br>\u3000Left hand: Q<br><br>Zoom Item (while holding an item):<br>\u3000Both hands: Hold both mouse buttons<br><br>Switch Cursor (when hands are out): Shift</p>","developers":["GIFT TEN INDUSTRY K.K."],"dlc":[3984610],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a